{"id":"n68448-2-9","stage":5,"title":"예물 · 礼物","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n68448-2-9-1","ko":"그거 못 보던 시계인데?","zh":"那不是我以前见过的手表吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그거","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그거：那个","readings":[{"term":"그거","audio":"/audio/4e2a8844f69b923decca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62251","senseId":"2","lemma":"그거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그거","audio":"/audio/4e2a8844f69b923decca.mp3"}},{"text":"못","meaning":"不会做动词所指的动作。","explanation":"못：不会做动词所指的动作。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}},{"text":"보던","meaning":"看","explanation":"보다：看；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보던","audio":"/audio/2e6646704459019ac5cf.mp3"}},{"text":"시계인데?","meaning":"钟，表","explanation":"시계：钟，表；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"시계","audio":"/audio/a658dc1b94077c9f96de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30190","senseId":"1","lemma":"시계","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시계인데","audio":"/audio/a1440c33b2274c282d9d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"4e2a8844f69b923d","term":"그거","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/4e2a8844f69b923decca.mp3","entryId":"62251","definition":"指代前面已提到过的对象。","pronunciation":["그거"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不会做动词所指的动作。","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛识辨对象的存在或外观。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"a658dc1b94077c9f","term":"시계","zh":"钟，表","audio":"/audio/a658dc1b94077c9f96de.mp3","entryId":"30190","definition":"指示时间的仪器。","pronunciation":["시계","시게"]}],"audio":"/audio/46fa61d5770e77204e24.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n68448-2-9-2","ko":"결혼할 때 남편한테 받은 예물 시계야.","zh":"这是我结婚时丈夫送给我的结婚礼物手表。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"결혼할","meaning":"结婚","explanation":"결혼하다：结婚；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"결혼하다","audio":"/audio/8f40b8da9c69319343f7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17314","senseId":"1","lemma":"결혼하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"결혼할","audio":"/audio/7856fb736c9b3d28451f.mp3"}},{"text":"때","meaning":"时，时候","explanation":"때：时，时候","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"1","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}},{"text":"남편한테","meaning":"丈夫，老公","explanation":"남편：丈夫，老公；한테：口语格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"남편","audio":"/audio/a4e8e584126026d6f8a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31919","senseId":"1","lemma":"남편","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남편한테","audio":"/audio/7fad29d5c01ec1d67e76.mp3"}},{"text":"받은","meaning":"收到 ，得到","explanation":"받다：收到 ，得到；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"1","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"받은","audio":"/audio/135720fd9fd0e73d4239.mp3"}},{"text":"예물","meaning":"礼物","explanation":"예물：礼物","readings":[{"term":"예물","audio":"/audio/a47ae229b9a88f018527.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68448","senseId":"2","lemma":"예물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"예물","audio":"/audio/a47ae229b9a88f018527.mp3"}},{"text":"시계야.","meaning":"钟，表","explanation":"시계：钟，表；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句